# AMS Builds — environment variables
# IMPORTANT: nothing is required to build or run this site locally.
#
# Content, brand, contact info, hero, Google tags, navigation, etc. are
# managed from the admin at /admin/ (Cloudflare Durable Object storage),
# with the git files in src/content/ as the baseline. Everything is
# editable by hand too — it is plain Markdown/YAML.
#
# Runtime secret (set in the Cloudflare dashboard, NOT here):
#   CMS_DEPLOY_HOOK  — Workers Builds Deploy Hook URL used by the admin's
#                      Publish button (Settings → Variables and Secrets).
#
# Optional build-time override (local/testing only):
#   CMS_EXPORT_URL   — where `astro build` fetches the content export from.
#                      Default: https://ams-builds.online/admin/api/export
